│  │
│  │ failures       failure decisions, including trials skipped because they already failed
│  │ crashes        boots that ended without a clean shutdown
│  │ last observed  the last failure seen in this session that changed what togi does; skips do not count
│  │ q              exit dashboard; tuning itself keeps running
│  │
│  │
│  │ WHAT TOGI DOES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
│  │
│  │ NIGHT       Until you end it, togi maps each unit's edge U, sweeps uncovered cells from U toward C, qualifies exact profiles, reproduces daily events and
│  │             runs controls. Idle time repeats exact-current-D qualification cells, never S-directed probes.
│  │
│
│   ?  help    l  log    esc  back    q  exit dashboard
